  },
  {
    "text": "常生",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.053261295326730004,
      "left": 0.44693278514696694,
      "width": 0.046029660838487745,
      "height": 0.015863094279513885
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "活",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.053261295326730004,
      "left": 0.49087769145303434,
      "width": 0.024293062773740735,
      "height": 0.015863094279513885
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "的织",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.053261295326730004,
      "left": 0.5130859996943549,
      "width": 0.046346845267562976,
      "height": 0.015863094279513885
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "锦",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.053261295326730004,
      "left": 0.5574741509077198,
      "width": 0.02428899630670129,
      "height": 0.015863094279513885
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "当然,问题也不少。今年1月,摊位费从每天35元",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.1305230806119532,
      "left": 0.18235676323513456,
      "width": 0.6780568097330485,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "涨到了50元,几位老摊主说这笔开销很难承受。停车",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.1647492696620524,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.7208056414935136,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "依然是最常见的抱怨:最近的公共停车场只有220个",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2004635538882428,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.7208285923258908,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "车位,通常上午9点15分之前就停满了。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.23468974293834208,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.5375634222536065,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "市议会正在考虑一项提案,计划在5月1日至10月31",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2704040271645325,
      "left": 0.18235676323513456,
      "width": 0.6780298555273653,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "日期间再封闭两个街区,禁止车辆通行。支持者认为",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3046302162146317,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.7208171489930344,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "这样可以多容纳40个摊位;反对者则担心送货不便,",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3403445004408222,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.7208056414935136,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "也担心老年居民出行困难。不少年轻人习惯用手机",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.37457068949092126,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.720809327535027,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "App付款,摊主们也陆续贴出了二维码。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4102849737171119,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.5445268973801284,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "眼下,一切照旧。到了中午,面包已经卖光,花桶",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4445111627672111,
      "left": 0.18235676323513456,
      "width": 0.6780358911922532,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "空了一半,喷泉旁边有一支铜管乐队在演奏(五位退",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.48022544699340153,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.7208171489930344,
      "height": 0.021815474983878938
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "休教师,自称“第二春”)",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5144516360435007,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.3442008121853822,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "。下午2点,卡车又重新装满",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5144516360435007,
      "left": 0.47642064903768044,
      "width": 0.3839880268473728,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "了。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5501659202696911,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.061083307731945403,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "关于封路计划的公开听证会定于3月14日星期四晚",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5843921093197906,
      "left": 0.18235676323513456,
      "width": 0.6780568099413818,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "上7点在市政厅204室举行。书面意见可在本月底之前",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.620106393545981,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.7208030969102863,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "寄送至秘书处。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6543325825960802,
      "left": 0.1395833275173611,
      "width": 0.2137915138691032,
      "height": 0.021815474983878994
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
